#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD0058 expect=skipped domain=CO
#note "CO is out of PMDA-SD0058 scope since 2026-10-02 (Domains.Exclude): SDTMIG 3.2 CO Assumption 6 grants COSPID among a closed list of identifiers and timing variables, so CO is checked by the split siblings PMDA-SD0058-C (3.1.2-3.2) and -D (3.3/3.4). COSPID here is not in the CO model list and would be reported if the CO exclusion were dropped."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-2
#library model-column-order CO STUDYID DOMAIN RDOMAIN USUBJID COSEQ IDVAR IDVARVAL COREF COVAL COEVAL CODTC
dataset CO
col STUDYID type=Char
col DOMAIN type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col COSEQ type=Num
col COVAL type=Char
col COSPID type=Char
---
S1 | CO | 001 | 1 | Comment | SP01
---
